; Subsuming an absent row builds it. A congruent spelling built later stays hidden.
; The live-row check fails; egglog's include-subsumed check succeeds.
(sort Math)
(constructor A () Math)
(constructor B () Math)
(constructor F (Math) Math)
(subsume (F (A)))
(union (A) (B))
(F (B))
(check (F (B)))
